^{:go/end 802} (go/method indexTokens "indexTokens indexes a slice of tokens, updates literalFreq and offsetFreq,\nand generates literalEncoding and offsetEncoding.\nIt returns the number of literal and offset tokens.\n" [^{:tag (* huffmanBitWriter)} w ^{:tag (* tokens)} t] :results [^int numLiterals ^int numOffsets]
